[Trigger]
Name	forge
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Ironbridge forges the arms of the kingdom, master, and it does it between three rifts of molten rock. Every crossing is a stone bridge, and every bridgehead is guarded. Warden Gareth Fenn has a good deal of time, so use yours well.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the heart of the rival keeper in the north-east hold.
Action	objective	1	Cross the three rifts by the bridges.
Action	timelimit	5400
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	westYard
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WestYard
Action	message	1	The west yard is a good place for a forge of your own. The first bridge lies just ahead.
Action	reveal	1	Foundry
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	foundryReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Foundry
Action	message	1	The foundry still has its furnaces lit. A rival keeper holds the far bank of the second rift and he is building bridges, too.
Action	reveal	1	CoalStore
Action	reveal	1	RollingYard
Action	objective	1	Cross the second rift.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	smithyReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Smithy
Action	message	1	The north smithy has a store of iron and heavy tools. Take it.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	depotReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Depot
Action	message	1	A heavy squad is marching out of the east to hold the depot bridge.
Action	spawn	3	70	56	1	Knight:2	Dwarf2:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	yardReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RollingYard
Action	message	1	The third rift is wide and its bridges are narrow. The rival keeper has put his best on the far side.
Action	reveal	1	RivalGate
Action	objective	1	Break through the gate of the rival hold.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gateReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RivalGate
Action	message	1	The hold is in front of you. Its keeper has called up everything.
Action	spawn	2	100	25	1	Orc:3	Troll:3	Goblin:3	Spider:3
Action	reveal	1	RivalKeep
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	keepReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	OreDock
Action	message	1	The ore dock feeds the rival hold. Hold it and he will starve his own forges.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	yardWell
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	RollingYard	100
Action	message	1	The rolling yard is yours, and the old quench pool under it still seeps mana. Use it to feed the last push.
Action	terrain	78	38	78	38	manawell	1
[/Trigger]
